### Day 7 - API smoke tests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)
@host = http://localhost:8080/api

### 1. Login as demo manager
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "manager@bugtracker.com", "password": "Manager@123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 2. Create a project (ADMIN / MANAGER only)
POST {{host}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Website", "projectKey": "WEB", "description": "Company website" }

### 3. List projects
GET {{host}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Add a team member (project 2, user 3)
POST {{host}}/projects/1/members/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create an issue
POST {{host}}/projects/1/issues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Footer link broken", "description": "404 on /about", "type": "BUG", "priority": "HIGH", "assigneeId": 3 }

### 6. Filter + search
GET {{host}}/projects/1/issues?status=TODO&priority=HIGH&q=login
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Move on the Kanban board
PATCH {{host}}/issues/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_PROGRESS" }

### 8. Assign
PATCH {{host}}/issues/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeId": 4 }

### 9. Comment
POST {{host}}/issues/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Looking into this now." }

### 10. Edit / delete
PUT {{host}}/issues/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Login page throws 500 on empty password", "description": "updated", "status": "IN_PROGRESS", "priority": "CRITICAL", "type": "BUG", "assigneeId": 3 }

###
DELETE {{host}}/issues/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Role check - developer cannot create a project (expects 403)
# @name devLogin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dev@bugtracker.com", "password": "Dev@1234" }

###
POST {{host}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{devLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nope", "projectKey": "NOPE" }
